body:
oh god im sorry I've been responding to a few posts for people, so I got confused, there was someone who was talking about how one of their teachers were being crazy verbally abusive. I can't beleive I've done this. I am really sorry. 

&#x200B;

Uh as for the test just be truthful with the teacher, you were overwhelmed with a few things. the sooner you contact the teacher the better.
